{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Pirates VR: Jolly Roger",
    "steam_appid": 1443620,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/c8dc9eaac88eaf927a95d86e7168fff3.avif?t=1748951017\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Embark on a thrilling VR journey in Pirates VR: Jolly Roger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where legends of lost treasure and cursed islands come to life! Stranded on a remote Caribbean island, you\u2019ll uncover dark secrets, face off against undead pirates, and fight your way through treacherous landscapes all while guided by your trusty, but sarcastic, parrot companion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experience the vivid beauty and lurking dangers of the Caribbean<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/2ff12bf1ce26493d2b88b5a5e34d08d8.poster.avif?t=1748951017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/2ff12bf1ce26493d2b88b5a5e34d08d8.webm?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/2ff12bf1ce26493d2b88b5a5e34d08d8.mp4?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From lush, vibrant jungles filled with wildlife to dark, cursed caves teeming with undead pirates, every environment is richly detailed and stunning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Journey across a stunning Caribbean island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/3df965d9616d6343dab962c93dd8738d.poster.avif?t=1748951017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/3df965d9616d6343dab962c93dd8738d.webm?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/3df965d9616d6343dab962c93dd8738d.mp4?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Filled with loot and secrets waiting to be discovered, from overgrown jungles to eerie caves, every corner of the island offers new challenges. You'll climb towering cliffs, swim through underwater caverns, and navigate treacherous dungeons to pursue the fabled treasure of Davy Jones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prepare for fast-paced, visceral combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/82b4fd8f2d48f1764a77c571b56fda93.poster.avif?t=1748951017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/82b4fd8f2d48f1764a77c571b56fda93.webm?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/82b4fd8f2d48f1764a77c571b56fda93.mp4?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>As You face off against cursed pirates, undead skeletons, and fierce creatures, use magic lantern and classic pirate weapons like flintlock pistol and other weapons as you fight your way through hordes of dark, malicious enemies. Whether you're dueling ghostly pirates or running away from wild animals, every encounter will keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test your wit as you encounter a variety of intricate puzzles scattered across the island<strong></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/1350bcd72a3fe889f1f92d3a82fbbd79.poster.avif?t=1748951017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/1350bcd72a3fe889f1f92d3a82fbbd79.webm?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/1350bcd72a3fe889f1f92d3a82fbbd79.mp4?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From unlocking hidden passages to disarming ancient traps, you\u2019ll need to think quickly and cleverly to uncover the secrets buried deep within the island. Every puzzle solved brings you one step closer to the treasure\u2014and the dark truth behind it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <br>Pirates VR: Jolly Roger delivers an incredibly immersive experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/5b7f8bc96a59d7bf5388666d3e9d5454.poster.avif?t=1748951017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/5b7f8bc96a59d7bf5388666d3e9d5454.webm?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/5b7f8bc96a59d7bf5388666d3e9d5454.mp4?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>With dynamic, realistic VR mechanics, climb rocky cliffs, rappel down ropes, swim through sunken grottos, and navigate tight cave systems, all in beautifully rendered VR. Feel the rush of the wind in your face and the splash of the sea as you explore this fully interactive pirate world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You're not alone on this journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/6ffe9ff7fd40374a0264a139107a0c36.poster.avif?t=1748951017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/6ffe9ff7fd40374a0264a139107a0c36.webm?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/6ffe9ff7fd40374a0264a139107a0c36.mp4?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Your hilarious parrot companion is always by your side, offering helpful advice, clues to solve puzzles, and cheeky commentary to lighten the mood. This clever bird is more than a comical companion. It\u2019s your guide to surviving the island\u2019s many dangers and unlocking its hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to claim the treasure and survive the dangers of the cursed island? Download Pirates VR: Jolly Roger now and dive into the ultimate pirate adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/c8dc9eaac88eaf927a95d86e7168fff3.avif?t=1748951017\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Embark on a thrilling VR journey in Pirates VR: Jolly Roger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where legends of lost treasure and cursed islands come to life! Stranded on a remote Caribbean island, you\u2019ll uncover dark secrets, face off against undead pirates, and fight your way through treacherous landscapes all while guided by your trusty, but sarcastic, parrot companion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experience the vivid beauty and lurking dangers of the Caribbean<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/2ff12bf1ce26493d2b88b5a5e34d08d8.poster.avif?t=1748951017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/2ff12bf1ce26493d2b88b5a5e34d08d8.webm?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/2ff12bf1ce26493d2b88b5a5e34d08d8.mp4?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From lush, vibrant jungles filled with wildlife to dark, cursed caves teeming with undead pirates, every environment is richly detailed and stunning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Journey across a stunning Caribbean island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/3df965d9616d6343dab962c93dd8738d.poster.avif?t=1748951017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/3df965d9616d6343dab962c93dd8738d.webm?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/3df965d9616d6343dab962c93dd8738d.mp4?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Filled with loot and secrets waiting to be discovered, from overgrown jungles to eerie caves, every corner of the island offers new challenges. You'll climb towering cliffs, swim through underwater caverns, and navigate treacherous dungeons to pursue the fabled treasure of Davy Jones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prepare for fast-paced, visceral combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/82b4fd8f2d48f1764a77c571b56fda93.poster.avif?t=1748951017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/82b4fd8f2d48f1764a77c571b56fda93.webm?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/82b4fd8f2d48f1764a77c571b56fda93.mp4?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>As You face off against cursed pirates, undead skeletons, and fierce creatures, use magic lantern and classic pirate weapons like flintlock pistol and other weapons as you fight your way through hordes of dark, malicious enemies. Whether you're dueling ghostly pirates or running away from wild animals, every encounter will keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test your wit as you encounter a variety of intricate puzzles scattered across the island<strong></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/1350bcd72a3fe889f1f92d3a82fbbd79.poster.avif?t=1748951017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/1350bcd72a3fe889f1f92d3a82fbbd79.webm?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/1350bcd72a3fe889f1f92d3a82fbbd79.mp4?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From unlocking hidden passages to disarming ancient traps, you\u2019ll need to think quickly and cleverly to uncover the secrets buried deep within the island. Every puzzle solved brings you one step closer to the treasure\u2014and the dark truth behind it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <br>Pirates VR: Jolly Roger delivers an incredibly immersive experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/5b7f8bc96a59d7bf5388666d3e9d5454.poster.avif?t=1748951017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/5b7f8bc96a59d7bf5388666d3e9d5454.webm?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/5b7f8bc96a59d7bf5388666d3e9d5454.mp4?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>With dynamic, realistic VR mechanics, climb rocky cliffs, rappel down ropes, swim through sunken grottos, and navigate tight cave systems, all in beautifully rendered VR. Feel the rush of the wind in your face and the splash of the sea as you explore this fully interactive pirate world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You're not alone on this journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/6ffe9ff7fd40374a0264a139107a0c36.poster.avif?t=1748951017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/6ffe9ff7fd40374a0264a139107a0c36.webm?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443620/extras/6ffe9ff7fd40374a0264a139107a0c36.mp4?t=1748951017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Your hilarious parrot companion is always by your side, offering helpful advice, clues to solve puzzles, and cheeky commentary to lighten the mood. This clever bird is more than a comical companion. It\u2019s your guide to surviving the island\u2019s many dangers and unlocking its hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to claim the treasure and survive the dangers of the cursed island? Download Pirates VR: Jolly Roger now and dive into the ultimate pirate adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Pirates VR Jolly Roger is a game alluding to old stories of the all-time most famous Pirates. The journey into the pirate world begins on a deserted island. Despite its extraordinary charm, the land hides a number of secrets and mysteries to be solved as well as obstacles and traps.",
